== Description ==

'''Electrical Wire''' is an electronic component in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Electronics Workbench]]. It appears as an ingredient in 12 downstream recipes at the [[Electronics Workbench]] and the [[Mechanical Workbench]], including [[Bicycle Generator]], [[Electric Motor Engine]], [[Driver's Seat]], [[Flexible Rotor]], [[Rotor]], [[Solar Generator]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

